<h1>Your email address was changed</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.name.presence || @user.handle %>,</p>

<p>
  The email address on your Shitcoin Swap account was changed from
  <strong><%= @previous_email %></strong> to <strong><%= @user.email %></strong>.
</p>

<p>
  If you made this change, you can safely ignore this email. If you didn't,
  please reset your password and contact us right away.
</p>
